    },
    "K3": {
      "desc": "The small inline 'access guide' link in the fine print at events.html:29 (CSS styles.css:200, 14px text, about 98.5 x 16 CSS px). The 2.5.8 Inline exception applies (target in a sentence, size constrained by line-height), it is underlined, and it has ample contrast. Reporting it as a 2.5.8 target-size failure is a false positive.",
      "row": {
